erennt results.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[other-terrain-tile-issue.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23229014/other-terrain-tile-issue.zip)\n\nI have an analysis and a PR on this coming. OP is just focused on the issue","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112186/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112186/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}